01:01:16.930 --> 01:01:17.250
Look out!

01:01:31.500 --> 01:01:42.900
Can I blow you, Ken?

01:02:00.120 --> 01:02:06.780
be over. And my work will be completed. An airplane is waiting to take me out of the

01:02:06.780 --> 01:02:29.720
country. Kent, if you hadn't been such a fool, you're not such a fool as you think. Carlos.

01:02:30.320 --> 01:02:34.500
Before I let you capture me, I had one of my men phone New York for help.

01:02:34.780 --> 01:02:35.100
Hit her!

01:03:20.350 --> 01:03:23.320
- That'll do you much good.

01:03:23.320 --> 01:03:24.450
- Give me a heat pump.

01:03:53.610 --> 01:03:54.730
Your friend was clever.

01:03:55.070 --> 01:03:55.860
Claver enough.

01:03:56.430 --> 01:03:56.810
No, no.

01:03:57.010 --> 01:03:57.650
Wait, the women.

01:03:57.890 --> 01:03:58.790
My time is short.

01:03:58.870 --> 01:03:59.750
I cannot wait.

01:04:14.270 --> 01:04:15.110
- What's this?

01:04:15.110 --> 01:04:29.380
- No, I'm all right.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:35.910
get him out. Now you see the men he got into? I told you how to beef we went to New York

01:04:35.910 --> 01:04:39.550
and lived on a roof. Men popping in at two o'clock in the morning and us having to flee

01:04:39.550 --> 01:04:43.750
out here into the country and getting mixed up with a gang of scoundrels like this. Bullets

01:04:43.750 --> 01:04:54.970
